46:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"One of the four Mahavakyas (great sayings) of the Upanishads: 'I am Brahman.' It is the direct declaration of Advaita's central insight — the individual awareness and the cosmic awareness are the same."}]
